# ── Live data API keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# All optional. With none set, the site still works — these update live for free with
# NO key (latest values AND trend lines):
#   World Bank  growth, CPI, per-capita GDP, unemployment, current account, fiscal
#               balance, trade, FDI, market cap, broad money
#   OECD        core inflation, wage growth, industrial production, retail sales,
#               consumer confidence, labour productivity, 10-year yields
#   BIS         central-bank policy rates, house prices
#   IMF WEO     government debt-to-GDP
#   ECB         FX
# Manufacturing PMI has no free source and stays clearly-labelled sample data, as does
# any economy a source doesn't cover.

# FRED — fresher DAILY readings on top of the keyless monthly series (US 10-year,
# effective fed funds, OECD long-rate mirrors) and US unemployment. Optional.
# Free key: https://fredaccount.stlouisfed.org/apikeys
FRED_API_KEY=

# Finnhub — powers Market Pulse (28 major stocks + top riser), Story of the Day news,
# and daily index moves. Without it those show an honest "feed offline" state.
# Free key: https://finnhub.io/dashboard
FINNHUB_API_KEY=

# Alpha Vantage — (1) backup for world stock markets (country ETFs) that Finnhub doesn't
# return, cached daily; (2) equity returns YTD + calendar-year history per market from
# TIME_SERIES_MONTHLY_ADJUSTED, cached a week per ETF and capped at 2 requests/minute and
# 8/day per server so the free tier (25 requests/day) is never exhausted — a fresh
# deployment fills all 25 markets over a few days.
# Free key: https://www.alphavantage.co/support/#api-key
ALPHA_API_KEY=

# Optional: protect the daily cron endpoint (/api/refresh). If set, Vercel Cron sends
# it automatically as a Bearer token. Any random string works.
CRON_SECRET=
